X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  What happens when your shadow decides to explo
 re the world without you? Head to the Monroe County Public Library Southw
 est Branch at 2:00 PM as Reimagining Opera for Kids presents <em>Ana y su
  sombra</em>!\n</p>
