 years of experience in Games. Throughout his career he has worked in-hous
 e at Riot Games as a Composer for both League of Legends and Teamfight Ta
 ctics\, written scores for indie games like Kenshi and SUPERVIVE\, and ha
 s spoken at various universities\, events\, and conferences including: Th
 e Game Developers Conference\, GameSoundCon\, The Society of Composers an
 d Lyricists\, and many more.
